{"ticker":"BDL","symbol":"BDL","instrumentId":3155065,"name":"Bharat Dynamics","industry":"NSE-Aerospace/Defense","about":"Bharat Dynamics Limited (BDL) is a key manufacturer of guided missile systems, underwater weapons, and other defense equipment for the Indian Armed Forces. BDL operates four manufacturing units across Telangana and Andhra Pradesh, with plans for expansion in Maharashtra. The company collaborates with DRDO and foreign OEMs to produce indigenous missiles like the Akash Weapon System and torpedoes. BDL has evolved into a complete weapon system integrator and is actively involved in the Atmanirbhar Bharat initiative. The company emphasizes innovation, including AI-based technologies, to develop next-generation weapon systems and enhance self-reliance in defense manufacturing.","website":"www.bdl-india.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:08:44.002Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":1032.45,"changePct":1.87981053878035,"week52High":1570,"week52Low":974},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹37,846 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹3,283 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"91,640,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"140"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"46,024,272"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.47%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"8.92"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.6"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.14"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.48"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-14%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"77.45"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–138"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"16.48"},{"label":"Volume","value":"562,546"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,122,623"},{"label":"Master score","value":"43"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"61"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"17"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"69"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"D-"}],"earningsAnnual":{"he